{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40130,"sections":[{"id":"script-20130","name":"原始脚本 20130","scripts":[20130],"start":0,"count":35}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:0","scriptId":20130,"text":"一边提防着旅行者的攻击，一边小心翼翼地和眼前的战车兽作战，虽然效率很差，但是也算是有点成效。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:1","scriptId":20130,"text":"战车兽的数量渐渐减少，这时对面的旅行者突然发话了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":400,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:2","scriptId":20130,"text":"“那边的人类！干得不错嘛～竟然能把这些战车兽都消灭了呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":400,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:3","scriptId":20130,"text":"虽然不知道那个旅行者说这话的意义，但是从她得意的语气来看，应该是有十分的把握。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":400,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":400,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:4","scriptId":20130,"text":"“我是约塔！记住我的名字吧～即将杀死你们的旅行者的名字哟～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":400,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":0,"speaker":"？？？","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:5","scriptId":20130,"text":"（不妙……这家伙要动真格的了！）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":400,"right":0,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:8","scriptId":20130,"text":"在这紧要关头，把事件的时间往回播一点……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:9","scriptId":20130,"text":"尤拉和艾丽莎正在海滩边的小店里吃铁板烧。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:10","scriptId":20130,"text":"“味道很不错。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:11","scriptId":20130,"text":"“是呢～这个味道真是让人欲罢不能～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:14","scriptId":20130,"text":"从度假村不远处传来了炮弹炸裂的声音，周边的人群也因为这声音焦躁不安了起来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:15","scriptId":20130,"text":"“那个……两位客人，不好意思，外面好像出了点事情，所以小店现在要临时打烊了，你们也快去避难吧！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":1,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:16","scriptId":20130,"text":"小店的老板对坐在店内的尤拉和艾丽莎说道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":1,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:17","scriptId":20130,"text":"“诶！？我还没有吃饱呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":1,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:18","scriptId":20130,"text":"“恩，请让我们继续用餐。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:21","scriptId":20130,"text":"炮击声越来越近了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:22","scriptId":20130,"text":"“真是不好意思，两位客人，你们想吃就吃吧，我得先跑了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":1,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:23","scriptId":20130,"text":"说完老板一溜烟得跑了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":1,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:24","scriptId":20130,"text":"“诶？那谁来给我们烤啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":1,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:25","scriptId":20130,"text":"没办法，尤拉和艾丽莎只能不情愿地离开了那间小店。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":1,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:26","scriptId":20130,"text":"周围是乱成一团的样子……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":1,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:27","scriptId":20130,"text":"“看情况是发生了什么不得了的事情呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":1,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:28","scriptId":20130,"text":"“我先去看看，艾丽莎你跟着人群先去避难所避难吧，恢复正常了以后，我们在这间店前集合。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":1,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:29","scriptId":20130,"text":"“没有问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:30","scriptId":20130,"text":"艾丽莎淡淡地回复了一句，确定没有问题以后，尤拉就消失在了人群之中。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:31","scriptId":20130,"text":"（看这样子好像是战车兽？打扰我用餐，真是罪该万死呢。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:32","scriptId":20130,"text":"但是考虑到尤拉是让自己去避难的，所以不能和尤拉跑去一个地方，所以艾丽莎只能去别处闲逛了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:33","scriptId":20130,"text":"避难这种事情对上位旅行者阿尔库涅来说，简直是天方夜谭……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:34","scriptId":20130,"text":"艾丽莎在空无一人的沙滨边走着，大多数人早就已经跑光了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:35","scriptId":20130,"text":"“人类真是脆弱，为了保全自己，活得如此小心翼翼……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:36","scriptId":20130,"text":"“这个星球的风土都比想象中的要好，本以为能在氧气中生存的物种肯定没什么闪光点，真是不忍心胡乱摧毁呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:37","scriptId":20130,"text":"艾丽莎很满足自己的人类身份，但是作为旅行者，她还是有一定的自觉的。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:38","scriptId":20130,"text":"突然天上闪过一道强光，紧接着大量的爆炸烟冉冉升起……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:39","scriptId":20130,"text":"“哦呀，这个武器……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20130:20130:40","scriptId":20130,"text":"艾丽莎测算了一下强光出现的位置，和尤拉所在的位置不同，于是她决定要过去看看。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
